From 730e74f8193c30ced82aa28740d70c6a2ebc17c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lena Okafor <lena.okafor@example.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 15:42:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(routing,skills): move harness family lookups into
 omnigent/harness_family.py

Smart Routing kept its harness -> family table in server/smart_routing.py,
runner/subagent_routing.py wrapped it in two more helpers, and
spec/skill_sources.py parsed the harness id for its own family. Adding a
harness spelling meant finding all three.

Add omnigent/harness_family.py with one harness_family() lookup. kind=
selects the routing family (the default, used by every routing caller) or
the skill family. Migrate every caller and delete the per-module copies.
Behavior is unchanged: the routing table and the skill-family parse are
carried over as they were, and the existing subagent-routing and
skill-source tests pass against the new lookup.

Signed-off-by: Lena Okafor <lena.okafor@example.com>
